000B98  1               
000B98  1               intro_msg:
000B98  1  57 65 6C 63          .BYTE   "Welcome to Wyrmhold. Seek the castle and speak with its ruler.",0
000B9C  1  6F 6D 65 20  
000BA0  1  74 6F 20 57  
000BD7  1               q_quit:
